Z||000000||87FieroGTx||09-17-2001||12:29 AM|||| My 85 GT auto kept dieing last month so I replaced the Alternator and it worked fine intill today(<P> I went to start it up today and the battery was dead.<P> I Jumped it then disconnected the NEG bat cable and it ran fine "Idled at 1.5k for 10 min then returned to 800"<P> So I took her out for a 50 mile drive, Everything worked fint till I shut her down to get gas, I tried to start it she fired up but you could tell power was low, When I got home I shut her down then tried to restart but there was NOTHING no lights no radio NOTHING. <P> Anyone have any idea what's going on???? ||||reg||5
