Z||000020||varnster||10-04-2001||10:45 PM||||Im sure you have already checked this but I <BR>didnt see it listed, insure the conections going to the alt are in good repair, free of<BR>oil,grit and grim. and take a volt meter to<BR>your battery when the engine in running and<BR>when it has stoped,go back a few hours later <BR>and check the battery again just to see if<BR>maybe something is draining your charge. stranger things have happened! good luck.||||reg||1
